{
  "_comment": "T-0656 SHARED PARITY FIXTURE. The SAME op vectors + expected results are asserted by BOTH the server TS ops (src/__tests__/form-document-ops-parity.test.ts) AND the client JS ops (web/src/forms/form-document-ops-parity.test.js). If either implementation drifts, its tier's test goes red against this fixture — mechanical proof that the human canvas and the agent machine seam share ONE op semantics. Edit ops in BOTH modules → the outputs here must still match.",
  "baseDoc": {
    "schemaVersion": 1,
    "source": {},
    "root": {
